# C++

- C++17+. RAII only — no raw `new`/`delete`, C arrays, `malloc`, `strcpy`. `unique_ptr` default. clang-format.
- Rule of Zero unless you define special members, then Rule of Five. `const&` for large inputs; `std::optional` / `std::expected` for absence and expected failure.
- CI: ASan/UBSan, clang-tidy. Tests: GoogleTest + CTest.
